            0.164
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）针对输入实例 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "n=5,w_{1}=11,w_{2}=5,w_{3}=4,w_{4}=3,w_{5}=3"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，根据（1）中设计的算法，给出求解的详细计算过程（用清楚明确的表格表示即可），并给出最小体重差（仅有该结果者此部分不得分）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.203,
            0.882,
            0.255
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "17. （共13分)问题背景与具体输入实例 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(n=5,w_{1}=11,w_{2}=5,w_{3}=4,w_{4}=3,w_{5}=3)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "同题16。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.139,
            0.267,
            0.461,
            0.287
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "请为之设计一个分支限界算法。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.299,
            0.612,
            0.32
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）请详细写出具体的估界函数和剪枝依据。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
